    "mlv2Resolve stays available in the menu bar (∞ icon). If the icon doesn't appear, the menu bar may be full: this window also opens when you double-click the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mlv2Resolve stays available in the menu bar (∞ icon). If the icon doesn't appear, the menu bar may be full: this window also opens when you double-click the app."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mlv2Resolve reste disponible dans la barre des menus (icône ∞). Si l'icône n'apparaît pas, la barre des menus est peut-être pleine : cette fenêtre s'ouvre aussi en double-cliquant sur l'app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
