    "To show your MLV files as DNG, mlv2Resolve needs FUSE-T, a free component that doesn't change your Mac's security. Installation asks for your password once.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To show your MLV files as DNG, mlv2Resolve needs FUSE-T, a free component that doesn't change your Mac's security. Installation asks for your password once."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour afficher vos MLV en DNG, mlv2Resolve a besoin de FUSE-T, un composant gratuit qui ne modifie pas la sécurité de votre Mac. L'installation demande votre mot de passe une seule fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installed version of FUSE-T (%@) is too old (minimum %@).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
