    "Project working and output color: DaVinci Wide Gamut / Intermediate. CST 01 converts P3-D60 / Linear to the working space. CST 02 converts to Rec.709 / Rec.709-A and starts disabled. Enable it only before a Rec.709 export.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Timeline color: DaVinci Wide Gamut / Intermediate. CST 01 converts P3-D60 / Linear to the working space. CST 02 converts to Rec.709 / Rec.709-A and starts disabled. Enable it only before a Rec.709 export."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Espace de travail et sortie du projet : DaVinci Wide Gamut / Intermediate. Le CST 01 convertit P3-D60 / Linear vers cet espace. Le CST 02 convertit vers Rec.709 / Rec.709-A et reste désactivé. Activez-le uniquement avant un export Rec.709."
          }
        }
      }
    },
